能需求\n十一、核心规则配置\n十二、平台化扩展预留接口\n十三、外部依赖与接口\n\nSo the actual document content covers 一 through 十三, which corresponds to TOC items 1-12 (plus 文档信息 as section 一). TOC items 13-15 (两个月上线计划, 研发费用预算, 合同关键条款) are NOT present in the document body content - they're listed in the TOC and version history but the detailed content is missing.\n\nThis is important to note in quality markers.\n\nNow let me create the comprehensive summary. This is massive, so I need to be very thorough. Let me structure it properly.\n\nActually, wait - the TOC has its own numbering 1-15 for the chapters, and the actual content uses Chinese numerals 一-十三. Let me map them:\n\nTOC 1 = 二 in content (产品概述)\nTOC 2 = 三 (用户角色)\nTOC 3 = 四 (账号准入)\nTOC 4 = 五 (核心业务流程)\nTOC 5 = 六 (C端)\nTOC 6 = 七 (门店)\nTOC 7 = 八 (推广人员)\nTOC 8 = 九 (Web后台)\nTOC 9 = 十 (AI)\nTOC 10 = 十一 (核心规则)\nTOC 11 = 十二 (平台化)\nTOC 12 = 十三 (外部依赖)\nTOC 13 = missing\nTOC 14 = missing\nTOC 15 = missing\n\nOK, so sections 13-15 of the TOC are not in the document body. This is a quality issue to flag.\n\nNow let me write the summary. Since this is an extremely long document, I need to be comprehensive but also structured. Let me follow the required format.\n\nFor \"文档概览\":\n- Type: Word (DOCX)\n- Title: 估机狮 — C 端回收小程序 软件开发需求文档\n- Version: V6.4\n- Date: 2026-07-26\n- Status: 一期开发确认版\n\nFor \"核心内容\", I need to go through each section and sub-section thoroughly. Let me organize by the original h1/h2/h3 structure.\n\nLet me also identify the data models, technical stack, and tables.\n\nData models/entities:\n- C端用户 (C-end users)\n- 门店老板 (Store owners)\n- 推广人员 (Promoters)\n- 渠道合作方 (Channel partners)\n- 平台运营 (Platform operators)\n- 平台质检 (Platform QC)\n- 平台客服 (Platform CS)\n- 平台财务 (Platform finance)\n- 订单 (Orders) - with order ID format GS20260726XXXXX\n- 虚拟账户 (Virtual accounts) - 冻结余额/可用余额\n- 保证金 (Deposits)\n- 门店 (Stores)\n- 物流 (Logistics)\n- AI智能体 (AI Agent)\n\nTechnical stack:\n- 微信小程序 (WeChat Mini Program)\n- 微信客服接口 + 大语言模型 (for AI)\n- 微信支付 (商家转账到零钱)\n- 京东