, \"design\": 0.4},\n  \"30\": {\"frontend\": null, \"backend\": 1.2, \"product-manager\": 0.2, \"testing\": 0.4, \"design\": null},\n  \"31\": {\"frontend\": 0.8, \"backend\": 0.6, \"product-manager\": 0.2, \"testing\": 0.3, \"design\": 0.4},\n  \"32\": {\"frontend\": 1.0, \"backend\": 0.8, \"product-manager\": 0.3, \"testing\": 0.5, \"design\": 0.8}\n}\n\n检查：28的testing 0.8，也算合理。30的backend 1.2，testing 0.4。29的design给0.4，27的design给0.2（弹窗可能用已有组件）。32的design 0.8，略高但合理。\n\n总人天大约：前端sum 0.8+0.6+2+0.8+0+0.8+1=5.8，后端sum 0.6+0.4+3+1+1.2+0.6+0.8=7.6，pm sum 0.3+0.2+0.5+0.3+0.2+0.2+0.3=2.0，testing sum 0.3+0.3+0.8+0.4+0.4+0.3+0.5=3.0，design sum 0.4+0.2+1+0.4+0+0.4+0.8=3.2。总人天21.6，合理。\n\n满足要求。"}}
